      "sources": ["https://developer.sslcommerz.com/doc/v4/"],
      "notes": "Path + SESSIONKEY param verified from the init response example (gw.php?Q=PAY&SESSIONKEY=...). Page content is simulator-owned with a SIMULATOR banner."
